        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDPA325, Heavy Duty Solid Brass Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on sliding pocket doors, this Heavy Duty Passage Set is for pocket doors that do not need to be locked like those leading to closets and hallways. It is for use on 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors. The Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull Set has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it is packaged as a complete set with all mounting hardware. Manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019's most complete provider for all your door hardware needs. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<table width=\"259\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDPA325-Specifications.gif?v=1704354597\" width\"259\" height=\"280\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SDPA325 Pocket Door Passage Set Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-privacy-pocket-door-lock-deltana-sdla325\"><b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock</a></b> & <a href=\"/products/double-thumbturn-pocket-door-lock-sdlla325\"><b>Thumbturns Both Sides Pocket Door Lock</b></a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDPA325 Pocket Door Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-3/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li>Available in including split finish (Polished Brass exterior / Polished Chrome interior).</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDPA325.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDPA325 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDPA325-install.pdf?v=1691095379\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDPA325 Installation Instructions (PDF)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Heavy Duty Passage Pocket Door Pull, Deltana SDPA325",
                "description": "Pocket Door Passage Set, Deltana SDPA325- For use on sliding pocket doors, this Heavy Duty Passage Set is for pocket doors that do not need to be locked like those leading to closets and hallways. It is for use on 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch thick pocket doors. The Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull Set has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it is packaged as a complete set with all mounting hardware. Manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019's most complete provider for all your door hardware needs. Available in 9 finishes.",
